    "引导程序": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "bootloader"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ブートローダー"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前 Mac 已迁移配对时可直接自检。USB 地址通常为 Android.local；Wi-Fi 请填写设备 IP。首次迁移读取本机已有配对，此后凭据独立保存，不再读取官方 App。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If this Mac's pairing has already been imported, you can run the self-check right away. The USB address is usually Android.local; for Wi-Fi, enter the device's IP address. The first import reads this Mac's existing pairing; after that the credentials are stored separately and the official app is no longer read."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この Mac のペアリングを移行済みなら、そのままセルフチェックできます。USB のアドレスは通常 Android.local、Wi-Fi の場合は端末の IP アドレスを入力します。初回の移行ではこの Mac の既存ペアリングを読み取り、以降は資格情報を独立して保存し、公式 App は参照しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前：%@ · 边距 %@ · %@ × %@\n%@ / %@": {
      "localizations": {
